      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 3813: 🔴 Source packs are removed right after `git_packbuilder_write(...)`, but the new pack files are never explicitly synced before deletion. A crash/power loss in that window can lose objects permanently. Please fsync the newly written `.pack`/`.idx` (and sync the `objects/pack` directory entry) before calling `removePack(...)`, so the old packs are only removed after durable persistence.",
      "revId": "f41e3bf1d5c6fdf30910229c7e8ee3c9610ea67a",
      "serverId": "1e26b4c1-6b8c-47ff-9df7-501b633d3b5a"
    },
