      "side": 1,
      "message": "The new pack is synced before any old one is removed. Jami enables GIT_OPT_ENABLE_FSYNC_GITDIR (src/manager.cpp:745), and the libgit2 indexer, which git_packbuilder_write() goes through, then fsyncs the pack (libgit2 1.8.0 indexer.c:1410), writes the index through a GIT_FILEBUF_FSYNC filebuf that syncs it and its directory (indexer.c:1325, filebuf.c:435 and 452) and fsyncs the directory of the pack (indexer.c:1431), all before returning. removePack() only runs after that. Patch set 2 says so in writeMergedPack().",
